    <p>See stakeholder list: <a href=3D"/spaces/COMPASS/pages/2689776031/Mu=
lti-Firm+Project+Plan">Multi-Firm Project Plan</a></p>
    <h2 id=3D"PRDUnifiedMultiFirmAccess-FeatureObjectives&amp;Metrics">Feat=
ure Objectives &amp; Metrics</h2>
    <p><span style=3D"letter-spacing: 0.0px;">By standardizing how multi=E2=
=80=91firm relationships and cross=E2=80=91firm user access are modeled in =
Compass, this feature reduces operational friction, minimizes the risk of i=
ncorrect firm context, and establishes a scalable foundation for future mul=
ti=E2=80=91firm capabilities, including cross=E2=80=91firm workflows and re=
porting.</span></p>
    <div class=3D"table-wrap">
     <table class=3D"wrapped relative-table confluenceTable" style=3D"width=
: 82.7147%;">
      <colgroup>
       <col style=3D"width: 6.09978%;">
       <col style=3D"width: 35.9247%;">
       <col style=3D"width: 57.9755%;">
      </colgroup>
      <tbody>
       <tr>
        <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">
         <p>Ranking</p></th>
        <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">
         <p>Feature Goal</p></th>
        <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">
         <p>KPI</p></th>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <p><strong>1</strong></p></td>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <p><span style=3D"letter-spacing: 0.0px;">Eliminate ambiguous rela=
tionships due to lack of firm relationship support</span></p></td>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"e7c19cb1-991a-45af-8dd7-863044d5182d">
           <p>Auditable firm-to-firm arrangements (intent capture, onboardi=
ng, offboarding)</p></li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"6b027546-19ea-4db4-b687-a8a73cbbf5c0">
           <p>Auditable user access based on firm arrangement</p></li>
         </ul></td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <p><strong>2</strong></p></td>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <p>Reduce friction for access to platform and its capabilities for=
 cross-firm users</p></td>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"d5d258a7-ac26-476b-bef7-bf26a784a75d">
           <p>Elimination in duplicate user profiles per individual (achiev=
e ~99% unified ID)</p></li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"51508558-f51f-4691-bae6-a562ed2731ca">
           <p>Elimination of access inconsistencies across CX and SZ (exclu=
ding NetRep, R2)&nbsp;</p></li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"7d0b1495-ff42-49c7-bbcf-b9c060b5b4fa">
           <p>Some edge cases may and can exist such as transitionary acces=
s</p></li>
         </ul></td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <p><strong>3</strong></p></td>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <p>Empower firms to have better control and oversight over their r=
elationships</p></td>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"ed6595e2-22f6-4d65-ac8b-c8c83fbe42b0">
           <p>Reduction in risk of or materialized data privacy breaches&nb=
sp;</p></li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"b7f1b152-8218-4570-b13c-c78d07224ca9">
           <p>Improved time to relationship and user onboarding / offboardi=
ng</p></li>
         </ul></td>
       </tr>
      </tbody>
     </table>
    </div>
    <p><br></p>
    <h1 id=3D"PRDUnifiedMultiFirmAccess-FeatureScope">Feature Scope</h1>
    <p>Two key capabilities will be introduced: the ability to manage aggre=
gation of firms and the ability to delegate relationships to other firms wi=
thin the NBIN network.&nbsp;</p>
    <p><img class=3D"drawio-diagram-image" width=3D"400" style=3D"width:400=
px;max-width: 100%;" src=3D"ddc9527062da86c532489dab312695881ae138f74135185=
5eaf1141368abd25d" height=3D"173"></p>
    <h2 style=3D"text-align: left;" id=3D"PRDUnifiedMultiFirmAccess-InScope=
"><span>In Scope</span></h2>
    <div class=3D"table-wrap">
     <table class=3D"relative-table wrapped confluenceTable" style=3D"width=
: 99.0582%;">
      <colgroup>
       <col style=3D"width: 13.0386%;">
       <col style=3D"width: 41.69%;">
       <col style=3D"width: 45.2714%;">
      </colgroup>
      <tbody>
       <tr>
        <th scope=3D"rowgroup" style=3D"vertical-align: middle;" class=3D"c=
onfluenceTh">
         <p>Capability</p></th>
        <th scope=3D"colgroup" style=3D"vertical-align: middle;" class=3D"c=
onfluenceTh">
         <p>Aggregate Firm</p></th>
        <th scope=3D"colgroup" style=3D"vertical-align: middle;" class=3D"c=
onfluenceTh">
         <p>Firm Delegation</p></th>
       </tr>
