        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"229971d3-2965-4507-8402-1c29bf7bd669">
           <p>Introduce aggregate firm structure, including firm grouping a=
nd unique parent identifier</p></li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"311a232c-ae55-496b-b50b-f85b0bddda46">Sync firm =
data from Firm360</li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"dc0af5ea-176c-4a2b-8cd7-3b59f6e42d24">
           <p>Enable feature package assignment to parent</p></li>
         </ul></td>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"1154bf1c-655d-45aa-8bc0-4022b7c09a51">
           <p>Introduce a source of truth for firm-to-firm relationships</p=
></li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"4e073c91-a2e1-410c-84ef-14f9e842002f">
           <p>Allow firms to self-declare&nbsp;/ setup delegate firm and se=
t the level of permissions (feature, data), for each delegated firm</p></li=
>
          <li data-uuid=3D"203678c4-464b-4166-917d-63a87f22b08c">Capture in=
 CX and send back to Firm360</li>
         </ul></td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th scope=3D"row" class=3D"confluenceTh">
         <p>User provisioning =E2=86=93</p></th>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"f168bce4-edc3-4fb9-b9b2-75eb58ef9d8d">Modify uni=
fied access request=20
           <ul>
            <li data-uuid=3D"c957f94b-2ae6-4aab-9421-57b0f4fde3e2">
             <p>Allow users to have RR access from 1 or more child firms</p=
></li>
            <li data-uuid=3D"fecbd83d-6724-4456-b5cb-c4ac8f17032a">
             <p>Allow users to have parent-level access profile</p></li>
           </ul></li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"bdf921e3-c7af-4744-9573-5bb64a3f9380">Unify firm=
 and user settings for parent firm, ensuring clear identification of parent=
 vs. child users</li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"ef1e70bb-e775-4bc9-88bb-e69b2a435d92">Update to =
ensure bulk file upload can specify parent or child firm</li>
         </ul></td>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"4f437c5a-500a-431b-b7fe-ac27a3a53271">
