       <tr>
        <th scope=3D"row" class=3D"confluenceTh">
         <p>Trade =E2=86=93</p></th>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"a62a4179-a906-46d4-ae09-0aaf655eaaac">
           <p>Access to full order management + TA capabilities, including =
bulk</p></li>
         </ul></td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th scope=3D"row" class=3D"confluenceTh">
         <p>Report =E2=86=93</p></th>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"39560cce-c357-45c9-a3fc-917d6f45db63">N/A</li>
         </ul></td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th scope=3D"row" class=3D"confluenceTh">
         <p>Access additional value-add services =E2=86=93</p></th>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"4d77805e-ef3f-43b3-81bb-ff1e20be32a5">Enable acc=
ess to subscribed parent level features&nbsp;&nbsp;</li>
         </ul></td>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th scope=3D"row" class=3D"confluenceTh">
         <p>Access to Legacy</p></th>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"e80b6828-55b8-4216-80b1-80f43eda9f5c">Enable lin=
kage of parent user ID to legacy ID</li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"66ed0154-1318-4d25-b5d4-aee91d777374">Introduce =
operational handling for multi-legacy ID scenarios</li>
         </ul></td>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
       </tr>
      </tbody>
     </table>
    </div>
    <p style=3D"text-align: left;"><br></p>
    <h2 style=3D"text-align: left;" id=3D"PRDUnifiedMultiFirmAccess-OutofSc=
ope"><span>Out of Scope</span></h2>
    <p style=3D"text-align: left;"><strong style=3D"letter-spacing: 0.0px;"=
>Legacy System Refactoring</strong></p>
    <ul>
     <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-uuid=
=3D"db5f9410-d8e1-4a55-ae16-4b510346626c">
      <p>Full remediation or redesign of<strong> </strong><strong style=3D"=
letter-spacing: 0.0px;">R2 or NetRep </strong>access models beyond what is =
necessary to support CX transition</p></li>
     <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-uuid=
=3D"72363d5d-7268-4df0-9869-3547a6c1a9db">
      <p>Cleanup of historical data inconsistencies or incorrect legacy use=
r setups in R2 or NetRep unless explicitly required for CX enablement</p></=
li>
    </ul>
    <p><strong>Historical data transition</strong></p>
    <ul>
     <li data-uuid=3D"53135206-4433-41e1-81ad-5013356dbc8e">We are not migr=
ating and merging data from child firms at the point of parent creation</li=
>
     <li data-uuid=3D"b430925b-51e2-4320-a674-5b526f090037">:question: Does=
 moving firm ID of a user count?</li>
    </ul>
    <h2 style=3D"text-align: left;" id=3D"PRDUnifiedMultiFirmAccess-KeyAssu=
mptions">Key Assumptions</h2>
    <ul>
     <li data-uuid=3D"2152cbeb-d06a-43bc-b2e8-e8b296cf7ffb">Permutations of=
 current setups =E2=86=92 assume this is chaotic and not understandable tod=
ay, instead we impose a new model&nbsp;</li>
     <li data-uuid=3D"ef010091-76c9-4fed-9ecf-d60d2b1dfc10">Firms may have =
processes today that may be impacted by this e.g. offline aggregation / rep=
orting - it's the firm's choice to setup multiple ID's if they really wante=
d to maintain status quo</li>
     <li data-uuid=3D"c58f3d88-4c58-4457-88a6-d84a2c67fe0f">There are no fu=
nky business rules that might not work at the parent level, e.g. admin file=
 uploads, trading restrictions or thresholds, etc.</li>
     <li data-uuid=3D"a30e80ec-1f6f-44c1-a04c-286787aef60e">Clients are ok =
to live with legacy multi-ID environment - we will not solve for it in R2 (=
cannot disable direct access now - we will need to accept this risk as an i=
nterim transitionary measure), NetRep;</li>
    </ul>
    <h2 style=3D"text-align: left;" id=3D"PRDUnifiedMultiFirmAccess-Feature=
Dependencies">Feature Dependencies</h2>
    <ul>
     <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-uuid=
=3D"7b3dd2aa-3263-49bc-9b3f-595427e63540">
      <p>Integration with 3rd parties to support a unified login experience=
</p></li>
     <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-uuid=
=3D"59fea7ef-c772-4f28-be5b-f3a968803d2a">
      <p>Timely ingestion and synchronization of firm relationship &amp; su=
bscription data from Firm360 or equivalent systems</p></li>
     <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-uuid=
=3D"6621ce94-901f-4593-ba4e-dd0e48c204b2">Pre-requisite for SZ SSO &amp; FG=
DA integration</li>
     <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-uuid=
=3D"d28530fb-2363-4213-b5e5-ff2da567e2e1">Pre-requisite for CX Trading laun=
ch (NetRep ID replacement)</li>
     <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-uuid=
=3D"3868a5df-42cc-4a2e-a9de-13120f38f054">May require revised unified acces=
s request solution</li>
    </ul>
    <p><br></p>
    <h2 id=3D"PRDUnifiedMultiFirmAccess-ProductVersioning">Product Versioni=
ng</h2>
    <p>See Aha</p>
    <p><br></p>
   </div>
  </div>
 </div>
 <div class=3D"columnLayout single" data-layout=3D"single">
  <div class=3D"cell normal" data-type=3D"normal">
   <div class=3D"innerCell">
    <h1 id=3D"PRDUnifiedMultiFirmAccess-FeatureRequirements:AggregateFirmAc=
cessLifecycle">Feature Requirements: Aggregate Firm Access Lifecycle</h1>
    <div class=3D"table-wrap">
     <table class=3D"relative-table wrapped confluenceTable" style=3D"width=
: 94.7723%;">
      <colgroup>
       <col style=3D"width: 11.1079%;">
       <col style=3D"width: 88.9329%;">
      </colgroup>
      <tbody>
       <tr>
        <th colspan=3D"2" scope=3D"colgroup" class=3D"confluenceTh">
         <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
          <h2 id=3D"PRDUnifiedMultiFirmAccess-1-ParentFirmSetup"><span styl=
e=3D"font-size: 20.0px;font-weight: normal;letter-spacing: -0.008em;">1 - P=
arent Firm Setup</span></h2>
         </div></th>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTh">
         <p>Roadmap Phasing</p></th>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
          <p><span class=3D"status-macro aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-success">N=
OW</span></p>
         </div></td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTh">
         <p>Problems to Solve</p></th>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"623860d0-a175-4638-9f89-95c22d25b51a">Enable par=
ent relationship to allow for onward unified parent-level user setup</li>
         </ul></td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTh">
         <p>Target Users</p></th>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"99386fb3-e994-4d0e-85bf-60b048819042">
           <p>NBIN Firm Implementations</p></li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"57f59ac7-451c-43b9-a5d6-149780102b7d">
           <p>NBIN Product Activations</p></li>
         </ul></td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTh">
         <p>Requirements</p></th>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
          <p><strong>Target Parent Firm Setup Flow</strong></p>
          <p><img class=3D"drawio-diagram-image" width=3D"468" style=3D"wid=
th:931px;max-width: 100%;" src=3D"8523a349153081aee49f5fafd9081690ba37453ab=
1055c63fb1f5db65cbc6baf" height=3D"70"><br><span>Grey =3D off CX</span></p>
          <p><strong>Firm360 registration</strong></p>
          <ul>
           <li data-uuid=3D"b107251f-2ab7-473e-876b-8c3936de6d8d">All featu=
re subscriptions, for both what's available on CX versus not, are elected a=
t this stage against the parent and applicable child firms in Firm360</li>
          </ul>
          <p><strong>Firm360 sync into CX</strong><span>&nbsp;</span></p>
          <ul>
           <li data-uuid=3D"235eae82-6dea-497f-865d-9a4397e442f7">Firm hier=
archy (<strong>parent ID</strong>, name + related child ID's) updates shoul=
d be reflected in CX as of firm registration in Firm360 (but can be overnig=
ht depending on feasibility)=20
            <ul>
             <li>:question: Update trigger</li>
            </ul></li>
           <li data-uuid=3D"d1b5e655-6ed1-497d-bd39-493776610184">Where the=
re are new firms, the firm should be created and relationships linked in CX=
=20
            <ul>
             <li>Firm registration &amp; lookup:=20
              <ul>
               <li>Firm should be searchable in CX firm list, firm list sho=
uld clearly show parent/child groupings an for ease of discovery</li>
               <li data-uuid=3D"d132fe64-2fd3-4b47-8953-c0a339819f0b">A uni=
que firm ID should be used to uniquely identify the parent firm and should =
be the same as Firm360</li>
               <li>No specific firm type is assigned to the new parent (or =
categorize as "parent"?)</li>
               <li>Firm profile should show linked child firms, and vice ve=
rsa when in parent or child firm profile</li>
               <li>Firm should remain deactivated/not available for user as=
signment i.e. no users can be onboarded until NBIN team completes feature a=
ssignments</li>
              </ul></li>
             <li>Firm package assignment:=20
              <ul>
               <li>A "parent default" firm package assigned (contingent on =
what is feasible to roll-up)</li>
               <li><span>Relevant feature subscriptions are appropriately e=
lected for the firm</span></li>
              </ul></li>
             <li data-uuid=3D"d6e22fb4-933d-4fef-9432-34111dd7cad5">RR's of=
 all child firms need to be available for assignment at the parent firm lev=
el</li>
            </ul></li>
          </ul>
          <ul>
           <li data-uuid=3D"bda932b5-3e1e-45f1-a777-0bbab3d50add">Where the=
re is an update of child link to parent (e.g. moving from one parent to ano=
ther parent):=20
            <ul>
             <li>Only the link / relationship should be reflected in firm l=
ist and firm profiles</li>
             <li data-uuid=3D"a8d7e31b-db3e-4700-8dd7-13bf19cf656d">Child f=
irm link is updated to new parent&nbsp;</li>
             <li>No changes should be made to firm feature assignments for =
firm activation status</li>
             <li>Where child has more feature assignments than parent, allo=
w assignment of that feature in parent</li>
             <li data-uuid=3D"60178037-1d0d-499f-bc72-743122622242">RR's of=
 child firm need to be available for assignment at the new parent</li>
             <li data-uuid=3D"3de072eb-5170-4977-81c8-b2ef45e1fa2d">Legacy =
parent would no longer have access to child firm RR that was moved; not nec=
essary to change global feature access</li>
            </ul></li>
          </ul>
          <p><strong>CX Firm Feature Assignment</strong></p>
          <ul>
           <li data-uuid=3D"d60b95ae-3f0a-4b98-bab1-e3769cc7676a">Firm shou=
ld be configured in CX (manual or automated) based on a core parent-level p=
ackage (same for all firms) + subscribed/unsubscribed features from Firm360=
</li>
           <li data-uuid=3D"4588b136-0241-4469-8035-4c7f257c4831">Same feat=
ure set should be made available for assignment in child firms</li>
           <li data-uuid=3D"e40ac34a-9c27-4299-8bc9-12c511cc4c19">Configura=
tion will be done by NBIN</li>
           <li data-uuid=3D"a618c7c7-b615-408d-bbd9-daedd2434cf5">See <a hr=
ef=3D"/spaces/COMPASS/pages/2757138977/Multi-Firm+Feature+Subscription+Prov=
isioning">Multi-Firm Feature Subscription &amp; Provisioning</a></li>
          </ul>
          <p><strong>CX Firm Feature Configuration</strong></p>
          <ul>
           <li data-uuid=3D"163cd0c5-dd5b-4a77-ab0b-1b54a3827080">Firms can=
 decide at time of implementation whether to show or hide features at paren=
t or child firm-level</li>
           <li data-uuid=3D"daf93583-a11b-4713-8b64-c1b37af67d65">Configura=
tion will be done by NBIN team until self-serve firm settings become availa=
ble</li>
           <li data-uuid=3D"27920b76-276a-434c-b5c3-228090b1368b">Firm can =
be activated for onward user assignment once NBIN team completes configurat=
ion</li>
          </ul>
          <p><strong>Firm Security Steward Assignment for New Firm</strong>=
</p>
          <ul>
           <li data-uuid=3D"49b7f339-c8d7-451b-ba0b-1d73061dafc8">
            <p>Initial security steward provisioning :question:&nbsp;</p>
            <ul>
             <li data-uuid=3D"b62bdfe0-a830-4432-a996-25c08ad5e4a3">Firm au=
thorization / pre-approval</li>
             <li data-uuid=3D"a7b42b8c-e5a0-4509-8c41-4cab4d7c1cdd">How do =
firms designate and who do they communicate to about this to NBIN</li>
            </ul></li>
          </ul>
         </div></td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTh">
         <p>Non-Functionals</p></th>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"cc09680f-d88a-4bdf-baa2-dc56d5bdf4bb">Timely ava=
ilability of Firm360 changes</li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"d02d1079-7d49-4ee0-83b5-09ff8f5fc45d">Change / e=
rror&nbsp;logging in the event of discrepancies or issues with Firm360 sync=
.</li>
         </ul></td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTh">
         <p>Out of Scope</p></th>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"22548a16-bc4d-41e8-8438-98da2a2fb2c8"><span styl=
e=3D"letter-spacing: 0.0px;">Self-serve firm settings for firms to onward c=
onfigure their parent &amp; child firm experience</span></li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"1137e58c-a371-4639-b7d9-fa0599417361"><span styl=
e=3D"letter-spacing: 0.0px;">Auto-cascade or inheritance of features pendin=
g needs (operational or technical)</span></li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"c11a3112-4382-436a-ba1f-15e7f8dd857a">Automation=
 of one-time bulk configuration from initial Firm360 load</li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"ea56d032-e7ff-4a3d-b52b-b78aa29b5e69">Parent-of-=
parent use case:&nbsp;=20
           <ul>
            <li data-uuid=3D"3512a1d6-5251-4902-a92d-7580acd0b27e">In acqui=
sitions child firms would re-link or merge or convert into new parent firms=
, rendering the legacy parent obsolete</li>
            <li data-uuid=3D"49e98c51-2050-4113-9cc9-3c048c335198"><span st=
yle=3D"letter-spacing: 0.0px;">Transitory edge case and can create exposure=
 to data leaks if e.g. acquisition transaction has not been finalized and o=
ne firm starts to have access to another firm's data</span></li>
           </ul></li>
         </ul></td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTh">
         <p>Acceptance Criteria</p></th>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"8f5f2a5a-ea5d-44f5-aa17-dc0857bf8cc7">CX is conf=
igured for the target parent/child firm based on Firm360 settings</li>
         </ul></td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTh">
         <p>Roadmap Dependencies</p></th>
        <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTd">
         <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
          <ul>
           <li data-uuid=3D"bf04467f-f1a5-44da-979b-d8e8859163d3">
            <p>Firm360 integration&nbsp;:question: are API's available for =
Firm360 so that changes can be retrieved versus relying on data files - inc=
lude <a class=3D"confluence-userlink user-mention" data-username=3D"norr003=
" href=3D"/display/~norr003" data-linked-resource-id=3D"9568275" data-linke=
d-resource-version=3D"2" data-linked-resource-type=3D"userinfo" data-base-u=
rl=3D"https://wiki.bnc.ca">Raymond Norris</a> in solution design</p></li>
           <li data-uuid=3D"568a048c-a684-4369-b8e4-b5cdfcf65b3f">Impacts t=
o <strong>"NBIN Internal" </strong>will require formalization of the LoB co=
ncept (currently hardcoded, does not exist as an identifiable "firm")</li>
           <li data-uuid=3D"38473b73-3ad3-4153-94a6-2c5c0bf9d17e">Feature M=
anagement across CX Platform &amp; Firm360</li>
          </ul>
         </div></td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTh">
         <p>Risks &amp; Constraints</p></th>
        <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTd">
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"90a84bfa-65b4-4c4a-ac89-a69008c64447">
           <p>TBC</p></li>
         </ul></td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTh">
         <p>Key Assumptions</p></th>
        <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTd">
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"2dc84f1b-d6df-4950-8a7a-a8c13377dbac">
           <p>Optional feature subscriptions will be available on Firm360 (=
pending scheduling in Q4)</p>
           <ul>
            <li>Includes one-time batch update of firm elections of existin=
g e.g. FundFacts</li>
           </ul></li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"b8fbc456-9909-4a5a-83d9-a5ff330ad588">
           <p><span>Billing agreement it is made clear to the firm on how o=
ptional features are billed since they will now be available in multiple pl=
aces</span></p></li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"ba609473-20ae-458d-b007-f4c8b5e28e06">
           <p>Billing logic will be derived offline based on CX assignment =
logic through reporting</p></li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"d8d1b49a-b567-4af7-99d0-f43cfd47acc4">
           <p>RR code migration e.g. during a conversion is handled at the =
time of firm implementation</p></li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"db0c1a12-c648-4cab-8238-ee25473f263b">Firm360 is=
 a trusted source of truth with sufficient data governance to not disrupt C=
X access integrity</li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"7f1f6fc3-c1a7-4648-9a2a-63483b1cbf8c">Creation o=
f new parent firms are invisible to the firms since they don't have Firm Se=
ttings - i.e. option to roll-out to firms anytime once live</li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"cd6861d1-6757-4903-af38-21b1b8758a0d">RR range s=
ync. within a firm (e.g. expansion of RR) are handled across all of the app=
s and appropriately cascaded from OSS when the changes are made</li>
         </ul></td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTh">
         <p>Open Questions</p></th>
        <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTd">
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"38d8d4c7-5fe7-401b-897d-40bf324288a6"><span>Faci=
litating assignment and access to "non-managed" solutions e.g. firm's direc=
t relationship with vendor TBC</span></li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"77e55f3c-6a24-47fe-a71c-e937c7c3d2a7">Tracking o=
f feature availability in CX where the feature is not yet on the platform e=
.g. Evercore</li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"32541b88-f27a-49e1-91e2-250dcbbe7e30">What are t=
he specific app restrictions that prevent parent aggregation and how do we =
handle them for parent level assignment (the ones that requires firm scopin=
g)&nbsp;</li>
         </ul></td>
       </tr>
      </tbody>
     </table>
    </div>
    <p><br></p>
    <div class=3D"table-wrap">
     <table class=3D"relative-table wrapped confluenceTable" style=3D"width=
: 1410.0px;">
      <colgroup>
       <col style=3D"width: 159.0px;">
       <col style=3D"width: 1250.0px;">
      </colgroup>
      <tbody>
       <tr>
        <th colspan=3D"2" style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" c=
lass=3D"confluenceTh">
         <h2 id=3D"PRDUnifiedMultiFirmAccess-2-UserProvisioning">2 - User P=
rovisioning</h2></th>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTh">Roadmap Phasing</th>
        <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTd">
         <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
          <p><span class=3D"status-macro aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-success">N=
OW</span></p>
         </div></td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTh">Problems to Solve</th>
        <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTd">
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"545a7978-03ce-4670-bf4c-1b96c5ce93d0">Eliminate =
multiple ID setups for parent-level users</li>
         </ul></td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTh">Target Users</th>
        <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTd">
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"235eddb7-8ec7-43bb-8ee4-2220d8162c34"><span styl=
e=3D"letter-spacing: 0.0px;">Firm Security Steward (parent or child)</span>=
</li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"c3e55b2c-d6ee-4a09-af14-7653d4b27daa">NBC ID Adm=
in teams</li>
         </ul></td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTh">Requirements</th>
        <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTd">
         <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
          <p><strong>New User Creation</strong></p>
          <ul>
           <li data-uuid=3D"dedaa51f-160a-407d-aeac-a008bae7ec3a">Introduce=
 a new unified request intake for user creation (in CX - one form to rule t=
hem all, replace iMOST UAF + R2 MyRequest)=20
            <ul>
             <li data-uuid=3D"13a97d5d-0be6-4bae-8ca0-00d696278458">FSS use=
r needs to be identified in CX to submit new requests</li>
             <li data-uuid=3D"0d587f68-03f7-4924-abc6-ad27817e63f5">FSS use=
r operate firm &amp; user management activities across the firm group</li>
             <li data-uuid=3D"a19ee091-531a-4b38-a970-93538d17329e">Request=
 should clearly signal firm context (firm ID, name, firm type) to avoid con=
fusion (or default to current firm context)</li>
             <li data-uuid=3D"5ce40d49-c1ab-4e61-9cf6-81b27b0d8a3f">Under p=
arent context, allow for setup across parent/child group, indicating which =
child firm(s)&nbsp;</li>
             <li data-uuid=3D"cc5d9b3b-7fc4-466d-814f-a281488ec99b">Under c=
hild context, only allow for setup within firm as it is today</li>
            </ul></li>
           <li data-uuid=3D"8d3cdb84-df87-488f-86e7-cb0e82d6a280">User RR a=
ssignment should include full available range depending on parent vs. child=
 context=20
            <ul>
             <li data-uuid=3D"abdeeeee-a68a-4607-8109-34ecaf2417da">Allow f=
or "parent firm-level access" under parent context</li>
             <li data-uuid=3D"1ea819ea-cd9c-4606-a2de-7643f8cc5cd3">Allow f=
or specific RR assignments across 1 or more child firms</li>
            </ul></li>
           <li data-uuid=3D"3939f122-4489-43bc-88ba-ffd9ed678ce5">Feature s=
election should be based on what is made available on parent firm-level con=
figuration=20
            <ul>
             <li data-uuid=3D"9cc8fc31-a820-4048-a57c-3d532b27d5e1">This me=
ans parent user can operate the same functions across all assigned child fi=
rms</li>
            </ul></li>
          </ul>
          <p><strong>User Provisioning</strong></p>
          <ul>
           <li data-uuid=3D"95648421-4188-414b-ac49-3015b66f80fc">Derive cl=
ear, step-by-step setup instructions for ID Admin team on platform includin=
g:=20
            <ul>
             <li><span>Firm selection (firm ID lookup =E2=86=92 need to be =
crystal clear the correct firm is selected and <strong>NOT </strong>rely on=
 firm name</span>)</li>
             <li data-uuid=3D"c5bb96ca-05e8-4cf7-bb42-595f9e08e2ca">For man=
ual :question: configuration in CX:=20
              <ul>
               <li><span>CX identity attributes</span></li>
               <li><span>CX role profile</span></li>
               <li><span>CX module selections &amp; overrides</span></li>
               <li><span>CX RR ranges</span></li>
              </ul></li>
             <li data-uuid=3D"4282c44f-5ec8-4464-9386-1bc669d32383"><span>F=
or manual configuration in SZ:&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>
              <ul>
               <li><span>SZ profile definition</span></li>
               <li>SZ app selection&nbsp;</li>
               <li>SZ RR ranges&nbsp;</li>
              </ul></li>
             <li data-uuid=3D"762dc2fc-fd1c-4ed7-9228-16b8bccd598e">For man=
ual configuration in R2 (until deprecated end of 2027):=20
              <ul>
               <li>R2 profile definition</li>
               <li>R2 app selection</li>
               <li>R2 RR ranges</li>
              </ul></li>
             <li data-uuid=3D"4e9f2603-304a-4917-b65b-89ae6b68c9ab">For man=
ual configuration in NR (until deprecated end of 2027, independent system f=
rom the rest):=20
              <ul>
               <li>NetRep profile definition</li>
               <li>NetRep RR ranges</li>
              </ul></li>
             <li data-uuid=3D"e7ab6fc0-5b8e-4215-92e8-d1f69e09f1b6">For com=
pletion of E2E configuration:=20
              <ul>
               <li>Link SZ &amp;&nbsp;R2&nbsp;ID's back to CX profile</li>
              </ul></li>
             <li data-uuid=3D"ec082135-be13-4be0-b095-5f2820e91f75">Complet=
ion of request &amp; credentials distribution cannot be done until above is=
 closed</li>
             <li data-uuid=3D"fbbfd16b-28a0-46f3-81e7-447e6d6df5e3">Include=
 new credentials in request response back to FSS</li>
            </ul></li>
           <li data-uuid=3D"8a869801-4ac0-4c8c-bb3d-497d9c06f4ae">Update CX=
 user settings to facilitate firm group functions, including:=20
            <ul>
             <li data-uuid=3D"ff683328-4a24-4ac8-9ddd-a07ed6abc9cd">Firm se=
lection</li>
             <li data-uuid=3D"c7b547c1-183c-47d1-8701-a6d6b97f0f2a">Feature=
 list based on the selected firm configuration (and defaulted to unselected=
) :warning: - would have to include bulk user upload, access instructions, =
employee SSO / access matrix definition</li>
             <li data-uuid=3D"0045b260-de9a-49b5-b0df-f2fefc3c6dda">RR assi=
gnment validation at parent-level</li>
            </ul></li>
          </ul>
          <p><strong>User Modification Requests</strong></p>
          <ul>
           <li data-uuid=3D"ed7b0552-753c-4fdc-9c06-cbe8eba5c467">Introduce=
 migration between Parent and Child or Child to Child within the firm group=
&nbsp;=20
            <ul>
             <li>Allow for selection of any firm within the firm group</li>
             <li>RR and feature selection should be reset for re-assignment=
 and based on firm configuration</li>
            </ul></li>
          </ul>
          <p><strong>User Offboarding Requests</strong></p>
          <ul>
           <li data-uuid=3D"ad2476f2-efdd-41e0-b09a-b757808339c5">Requests =
can be submitted by FSS for users belonging their firm&nbsp;</li>
           <li data-uuid=3D"865ab3d8-3477-430e-87a2-22f5faa76135">Deprovisi=
oning instructions to ID Admin team should include disabling off ALL linked=
 ID's</li>
          </ul>
          <p><strong>User Request Tracking</strong></p>
          <ul>
           <li data-uuid=3D"2e32a76d-89e7-4c89-a98c-935fe50466c5">FSS can s=
ee status of all submitted request and details of the request&nbsp;</li>
           <li data-uuid=3D"54f075c6-2f2a-42ff-b54b-d428060f09dc">ID Admin =
can update request status, share credentials</li>
           <li data-uuid=3D"1ee87edb-4145-4581-b448-7e0633ed469c">Closed re=
quests should be archived after 18 months but retrievable for auditing purp=
oses</li>
          </ul>
          <p><strong>Change Audit Trail</strong></p>
          <ul>
           <li data-uuid=3D"53dd7c50-93fa-4661-8bde-8e5bd96942b6">Firm chan=
ges against user should now be included</li>
          </ul>
         </div></td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTh">Non-Functionals</th>
        <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTd">
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"af9309cc-1653-4711-bb39-a0bd080739dd">Maintain 4=
8-hr SLA for manual access processing</li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"9b96e9fd-8f83-4a72-b9f9-c4280f1ac2e6">Logging fo=
r all user and system changes</li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"328752f0-8e74-40d4-acb7-6c7335c8e239">Security: =
temp password expiry policy / temp password distribution solution</li>
         </ul></td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTh">Out of Scope</th>
        <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTd">
         <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
          <ul>
           <li data-uuid=3D"d1ef42ea-8321-4933-a0be-e01ba85f54b6">Bulk init=
ial user setups of parent users - assume very low in numbers</li>
           <li data-uuid=3D"c6e511d7-41b4-4019-ae27-6691f3245e66">Notificat=
ion of request completion - to be added when email notifications / in-app n=
otifications become available</li>
           <li data-uuid=3D"75fb574a-e265-4125-8051-d075517b7fae">Handling =
of multiple legacy R2 ID's linked to a single CX profile - ride out the pai=
n until R2 is deprecated, we will need to keep direct R2/R1 login</li>
           <li data-uuid=3D"0bb9c580-9ec0-4c9e-a80f-49bc3692f72b">Facilitat=
ion of multi-step task management for ID Admin (assume no changes to curren=
t ID Admin workflow, revisit if there is a need post MVP esp. w/ ServiceNow=
 integration)</li>
           <li data-uuid=3D"81e291bf-4180-4d80-86c2-995e8d7ca774">User Requ=
est Approvals - legacy concept that adds overhead, large firms requiring th=
is have their own solution on Day 1</li>
          </ul>
         </div></td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTh">Acceptance Criteria</th>
        <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTd">
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"3f8a9410-3489-4196-9b46-7f52f9cb785d">User is su=
ccessfully requested and configured under a single ID</li>
         </ul></td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTh">Roadmap Dependencies</th>
        <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTd">
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"756f9fc6-434e-4a08-9790-f40af6013a24"><span styl=
e=3D"letter-spacing: 0.0px;">Client-side FSS access needs to be defined as =
part of this setup</span></li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"5eb70f16-4e36-4128-84ff-5aa6222e5ab7">FGDA depen=
dency to sync RR access for enforcement (need to investigate full extent of=
 the dependency including timeliness of changes, timeline of implementation=
, app readiness, etc.) + clean-up of sources of truth for RR's between AS40=
0, FGDA, Firm360, CX F&amp;UM =E2=86=92 EDGE ARCHITECTURE (which should als=
o take into consideration transitionary support)</li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"7c2475ca-b852-440a-8752-ac5b5fdf465f">Post launc=
h: deactivation of existing R2 security steward portal, R2 myRequest, iMOST=
 UAF for clients</li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"a6c07b54-219c-4e30-a64d-c1dc254759e5">NBIN Inter=
nal is currently a parent to all and "firm range" is implemented in a weird=
 way which may impact this implementation</li>
         </ul></td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTh">Risks &amp; Constraints</th>
        <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTd">
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"3bd479cc-d736-4c3f-b656-ba1d9568fbc9">Setup requ=
est handling via ID Admin can cause even MORE confusion without appropriate=
 intake</li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"8d1e7be3-72a1-4a8f-8c1f-b1560070ddbd">ServiceNow=
 integration black hole for ID Admin Team - avoid an integration project as=
 much as possible to not add another dependency impacting time-to-market (c=
an take our time later)</li>
         </ul></td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTh">Key Assumptions</th>
        <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTd">
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"963e8cd5-0b8f-4399-97ea-b84fede1a5a2">Security r=
isks are being managed now through appropriate parent vs. child setup assig=
nment definitions (i.e. eliminating "hacks")</li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"fb294ac9-03fd-410c-adbf-e776cf945de1">Downstream=
 automation of user provisioning will not be available (to require systemat=
ic handling of asynchronous provisioning)</li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"b57b98ba-70a6-44d8-a487-4cc146ec8f4d">No blocker=
s to distribute temp passwords from ID Admin team to FSS</li>
         </ul></td>
       </tr>
      </tbody>
     </table>
    </div>
    <p><span style=3D"letter-spacing: 0.0px;">&nbsp;</span></p>
    <div class=3D"table-wrap">
     <table class=3D"relative-table wrapped confluenceTable" style=3D"width=
: 1410.0px;">
      <colgroup>
       <col style=3D"width: 159.0px;">
       <col style=3D"width: 1250.0px;">
      </colgroup>
      <tbody>
       <tr>
        <th colspan=3D"2" style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" c=
lass=3D"confluenceTh">
         <h2 id=3D"PRDUnifiedMultiFirmAccess-3-UserMonitoring">3 - User Mon=
itoring</h2></th>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTh">Roadmap Phasing</th>
        <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTd">
         <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
          <p><span class=3D"status-macro aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-moved">NEX=
T</span></p>
         </div></td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTh">Problems to Solve</th>
        <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTd">
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"df87de68-66d9-4826-9f6f-949513a248c4">Improve vi=
sibility and control over users under the firm hierarchy</li>
         </ul></td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTh">Target Users</th>
        <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTd">
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"e1ef791e-a695-4db2-8225-0f7dbd718309"><span>Firm=
 Security Steward (parent or child)</span></li>
         </ul></td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTh">Requirements</th>
        <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTd">
         <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
          <p><strong>User Monitoring</strong></p>
          <ul>
           <li data-uuid=3D"91e25221-bbcf-405d-b98e-a4f71aa3ec58">Introduce=
 user settings to FSS (both parent and child): enhance user list to make it=
 usable for FSS - exclude role information, OSS user ID, include only assig=
ned features=20
            <ul>
             <li data-uuid=3D"275379aa-a522-42eb-a4b8-1ac6030f52cb">:questi=
on: Package basic (i.e. "safe") functions to FSS - passwords / 2FA resets, =
change firm, RR updates, language / default modules, deactivate user to sav=
e time for FSS and us</li>
            </ul></li>
           <li data-uuid=3D"8c6fb4c9-c398-454e-ac36-c709ad6b8f2c"><span sty=
le=3D"letter-spacing: 0.0px;">Introduce parent-level user settings for FSS:=
 </span>Provide aggregated view of all users across parent &amp; child firm=
s</li>
          </ul>
          <p><strong>User Attestations (Minimum - user reporting)</strong><=
/p>
          <ul>
           <li data-uuid=3D"1844f32b-35ae-47f7-b78d-d00b91a5dbed">Include d=
istribution of attestations at both parent and child-level to each FSS (sep=
arate files per firm) in target solution</li>
           <li data-uuid=3D"da3ac789-72c0-45fb-8f29-c6c7ea5248b7">Parent fi=
rm users must be explicitly identifiable in external user attestation outpu=
ts</li>
           <li data-uuid=3D"66f2ab97-4369-4c9e-9dab-57bfd782c0cb">Enhance t=
arget solution to include all available features on CX (i.e. SZ, R2)</li>
          </ul>
          <p><strong>Usage Reporting</strong></p>
          <ul>
           <li data-uuid=3D"281f02c6-0697-4697-a8ee-cb3962382afa">Provide F=
irm360 with user assignment data for all features across all firms</li>
           <li data-uuid=3D"6955fcd8-e35b-4ac6-b735-15f0b35e14a7">Report sh=
ould include: user ID, assigned firm ID, assigned features, assigned RR's; =
verify with&nbsp;<a class=3D"confluence-userlink user-mention" data-usernam=
e=3D"norr003" href=3D"/display/~norr003" data-linked-resource-id=3D"9568275=
" data-linked-resource-version=3D"2" data-linked-resource-type=3D"userinfo"=
 data-base-url=3D"https://wiki.bnc.ca">Raymond Norris</a>&nbsp;</li>
          </ul>
         </div></td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTh">Non-Functionals</th>
        <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTd">
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"c780b35b-0148-41f6-bfe8-1e4994352c36">High relia=
bility requirement on user data, particularly the user status</li>
         </ul></td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTh">Out of Scope</th>
        <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTd">
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"d2898954-3e97-4924-bda7-3c766c8da008">Integrated=
 NetRep / R2 attestations</li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"035b65f1-47ea-4574-864e-490924599121">Modificati=
ons to current attestation reporting processes</li>
         </ul></td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTh">Acceptance Criteria</th>
        <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTd">
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"5e0850f3-4527-4811-b26b-14cd454fab57">Firms are =
able to continuously supervise their users and consistently perform regular=
 user reviews</li>
         </ul></td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTh">Roadmap Dependencies</th>
        <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTd">
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"b7580ce5-457c-479d-8143-730500b8027d">Enhancemen=
ts to the current external user attestation solution</li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"341e499c-859c-4b1b-be55-87814259df7d">Pre-requis=
ite - need to nail down product capability model and its representation on =
CX</li>
         </ul></td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTh">Risks &amp; Constraints</th>
        <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTd">
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"d00ef24c-825d-4bf8-b541-da90ad758b9f">NBIN Inter=
nal does not support the aggregate concept today, adding the aggregate supp=
ort for parent firms may positively or negatively impact the current soluti=
on</li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"1fe5e36c-83a8-4977-bd36-4faf5fbee964">Key limita=
tion is on use package to support Manage Users, consider a separate login a=
s an option for platform admin.</li>
         </ul></td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTh">Key Assumptions</th>
        <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTd">
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"b787ed04-4a33-4503-bb22-9f00e143fca1">Child firm=
 FSS will continue to get what they get today for attestations</li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"026d9c9a-8a9a-43b7-8a08-f22f37eb7d72">Use case a=
ssumption - parent firm FSS has supervisory/operational role across all fir=
m environments, so actions should be available for those users across all f=
irm environments</li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"0c3d1298-ee45-40f8-9b01-f626a96a0828">If we intr=
oduce self-serve User Management, pre-GA features should still be hidden / =
not assignable to FSS which is managed by our product activation process to=
day</li>
         </ul></td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTh">Open Questions</th>
        <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTd">
         <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
          <ul>
           <li data-uuid=3D"ba2c1803-80ec-4d6a-a10c-d59e0a89b1fe">:question=
: What are the functional (<a class=3D"confluence-userlink user-mention" da=
ta-username=3D"soc007" href=3D"/display/~soc007" data-linked-resource-id=3D=
"9568271" data-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-linked-resource-type=3D"u=
serinfo" data-base-url=3D"https://wiki.bnc.ca">Candi So</a> ) / UX issues (=
<a class=3D"confluence-userlink user-mention" data-username=3D"mulo002" hre=
f=3D"/display/~mulo002" data-linked-resource-id=3D"942310056" data-linked-r=
esource-version=3D"1" data-linked-resource-type=3D"userinfo" data-base-url=
=3D"https://wiki.bnc.ca">Owen Mullings</a> ) with User Management today in =
Production as input into User Monitoring gaps</li>
          </ul>
         </div></td>
       </tr>
      </tbody>
     </table>
    </div>
    <p><br></p>
