enceTh"><span style=3D"color:#8590a2;">Requirements</span></th>
        <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTd">
         <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
          <ul>
           <li data-uuid=3D"05301086-0d16-439e-918d-66da5ceeba9f"><span sty=
le=3D"color:#8590a2;">Enhance external SSO solution to allow users to be pr=
ovisioned as parent or child</span></li>
