    <p><br></p>
    <div class=3D"table-wrap">
     <table class=3D"relative-table wrapped confluenceTable" style=3D"width=
: 1456.0px;">
      <colgroup class=3D"">
       <col class=3D"" style=3D"width: 210.0px;">
       <col class=3D"" style=3D"width: 1245.0px;">
      </colgroup>
      <tbody class=3D"">
       <tr class=3D"">
        <th colspan=3D"2" style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" c=
lass=3D"confluenceTh">
         <h2 id=3D"PRDUnifiedMultiFirmAccess-5-FirmFeatureManagement">5 - F=
irm Feature Management&nbsp;</h2></th>
       </tr>
       <tr class=3D"">
        <th style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTh">Roadmap Phasing</th>
        <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTd">
         <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
          <p><span class=3D"status-macro aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-moved">NEX=
T</span></p>
         </div></td>
       </tr>
       <tr class=3D"">
        <th style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTh">Problems to Solve</th>
        <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTd">
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"00acbe2a-5eb4-468a-97d5-34f5ba4a3e82">Prevent fe=
atures being out of sync between Firm360 &amp; CX</li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"32d3f761-9b17-43f8-abad-0e376d0ee024">Enable new=
 add-on, on-platform features to be available for firm assignment post feat=
ure onboarding</li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"385c4cc9-b42a-436c-b416-69a043cb9813">Enable new=
 add-on, off-platform features to be available for app maintenance (e.g. sy=
stem health) post feature onboarding</li>
         </ul></td>
       </tr>
       <tr class=3D"">
        <th style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTh">Target Users</th>
        <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTd">
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"1c59b5cf-bcd6-4d5b-a0d0-3e2e547b0ef8">NBIN firm =
implementation</li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"68dfb887-8b8f-4e53-bccc-8671c016e3a7">NBIN Produ=
ct Activations</li>
         </ul></td>
       </tr>
       <tr class=3D"">
        <th style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTh">Requirements</th>
        <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTd">
         <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
          <ul>
           <li data-uuid=3D"3b8a3f70-0914-4581-be0b-7df504ae2b51">On new fe=
ature registration in CX, provide change to Firm360 along with firm package=
 assignment reporting (e.g. IIS, SZ, CX native features)=20
            <ul>
             <li data-uuid=3D"2b894578-4890-4874-9fbe-97a096d986fc">Feature=
 lifecycle functions should be managed by CX =E2=86=92 i.e. onboarding, sub=
scription, assignment, enforcement, offboarding&nbsp;</li>
            </ul></li>
           <li data-uuid=3D"7982eeb1-bb0f-4b03-8b53-3c138029da7a">On new fe=
ature registration of non-CX features, only add those to System Health Stat=
us module for downstream use (e.g. D1g1t, Croesus, Evercore Research)=20
            <ul>
             <li data-uuid=3D"00ffc4a2-b360-4ba5-bbe2-0686a8d16278">Firm360=
 manages subscription only, assignment / enforcement done within the app</l=
i>
            </ul></li>
           <li data-uuid=3D"86a5a72e-8111-4109-a073-d8f9dcaa2e74">Feature s=
ubscriptions for add-ons should be managed in one place&nbsp;</li>
          </ul>
         </div></td>
       </tr>
       <tr class=3D"">
        <th style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTh">Non-Functionals</th>
        <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTd">
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"cebec793-a64d-42d5-a4df-115e4e8c71e2">Minimum da=
ily alignment</li>
         </ul></td>
       </tr>
       <tr class=3D"">
        <th style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTh">Out of Scope</th>
        <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTd">
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"46604598-59e4-4e85-b026-b892050ca9ec">Feature on=
boarding/cataloging of non-NBIN features, e.g. NDEX, since these are not fe=
atures</li>
         </ul></td>
       </tr>
       <tr class=3D"">
        <th style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTh">Acceptance Criteria</th>
        <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTd">
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"040c6134-5268-4bd4-85ee-ee5e75fa56bd">New featur=
es&nbsp;</li>
         </ul></td>
       </tr>
       <tr class=3D"">
        <th style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTh">Roadmap Dependencies</th>
        <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTd">
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"3f4e6447-775e-460b-b3ac-94c9b94b9bae">Clarificat=
ion required on degree of centralization of feature / subscription manageme=
nt (currently semi-distributed depending on the platform); when to decentra=
lize (e.g. IIS tools versus Partnership features)</li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"1bfd5f6c-bd73-4bd2-8aaf-76ebc46291c8">Feature li=
st and feature lifecycle management alignment with Firm360</li>
         </ul></td>
       </tr>
       <tr class=3D"">
        <th style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTh">Risks &amp; Constraints</th>
        <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTd">
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"d85fbfe8-5b48-4a6a-9a66-8357db0a392b">TBC</li>
         </ul></td>
       </tr>
       <tr class=3D"">
        <th style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTh">Key Assumptions</th>
        <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTd">
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"bf690e1d-f7c6-49df-994b-f9565fff2bc2">Two possib=
le entry points for features - on-platform comes from CX, off-platform come=
s from Firm360</li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"28f4993f-9321-454b-816d-96fbcb654882">After MVP,=
 BAU feature onboarding continues in CX and will not be interrupted without=
 this feature</li>
         </ul></td>
       </tr>
      </tbody>
     </table>
    </div>
    <p><br></p>
   </div>
  </div>
 </div>
 <div class=3D"columnLayout single" data-layout=3D"single">
  <div class=3D"cell normal" data-type=3D"normal">
   <div class=3D"innerCell">
    <h1 id=3D"PRDUnifiedMultiFirmAccess-FeatureRequirements:AggregateFirmOp=
erations"><span>Feature Requirements: Aggregate Firm Operations</span></h1>
    <div class=3D"table-wrap">
     <table class=3D"relative-table wrapped confluenceTable" style=3D"width=
: 1462.0px;">
      <colgroup>
       <col style=3D"width: 210.0px;">
       <col style=3D"width: 1251.0px;">
      </colgroup>
      <tbody>
       <tr>
        <th colspan=3D"2" style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" c=
lass=3D"confluenceTh">
         <h2 id=3D"PRDUnifiedMultiFirmAccess-1-PlatformAccess">1 - Platform=
 Access</h2></th>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTh">Roadmap Phasing</th>
        <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTd">
         <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
          <p><span class=3D"status-macro aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-success">N=
OW</span></p>
         </div></td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTh">Problems to Solve</th>
        <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTd">
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"346effc1-1f6a-4450-bcba-08f929f0ed97">Eliminate =
multiple ID's for parent-level users to access their firm environments</li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"3680cd42-57cc-4cb7-9ccc-c0d148b44953">Minimize d=
uplicate operations across child firms</li>
         </ul></td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTh">Target Users</th>
        <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTd">
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"73d3eea1-ce7d-4cff-a95f-2c65d66fab9e"><span>Pare=
nt firm users</span></li>
         </ul></td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTh">Requirements</th>
        <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTd">
         <p><strong>Unified login &amp; global access</strong></p>
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"a9e8efc4-c865-4f5e-8a6f-f332a331225e">Default to=
 parent firm context - ensure firm context is extremely clear to avoid conf=
usion on where the user is operating under</li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"06b5e18a-4fec-4779-907c-82f774464cf1">Apps and d=
ata presented based on parent profile (aggregate views)</li>
         </ul>
         <p><strong>Child firm interactions from parent (aggregation)</stro=
ng></p>
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"b61d787c-3ba9-4855-a34f-fef03bf0ca8a">Allow user=
 to slice / filter operations at firm-level across supported apps e.g. only=
 see accounts child firm A but not child firm B</li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"8c827c13-cf2d-4f47-9362-d611278af372">Provide co=
nsolidated actions across child firm accounts</li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"1061d278-b4a7-4b34-b340-826cf6a88c11">In-app act=
ions requiring specific firm context (e.g. firm type, firm ID) need to be c=
ontextual to where the client account belongs</li>
         </ul>
         <p>Ensure aggregate bundling is cleaned up for Manage Firm &amp; M=
anage User</p>
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"2cabf0c9-5458-48f1-9bd6-1e5db2a8f952">Review NBI=
N Internal (LoB) only features that now need to be brought into parent / ch=
ild firm package</li>
         </ul></td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTh">Non-Functionals</th>
        <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTd">
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"a012ea3d-9b65-4407-93a0-821e3c3ebf52">TBC</li>
         </ul></td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTh">Out of Scope</th>
        <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTd">
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"9169266c-6313-4925-9333-aa7ec2a05858">N/A</li>
         </ul></td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTh">Acceptance Criteria</th>
        <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTd">Parent user can access across assigned child firms without separate=
 logins</td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTh">Roadmap Dependencies</th>
        <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTd">
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"cb026eed-b47a-4ad7-88cd-61349a5ce314">SZ SOO &am=
p; FGDA</li>
         </ul></td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTh">Risks &amp; Constraints</th>
        <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTd">
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"390ff9ce-3645-426e-bad9-8647950444c2">Analysis r=
equired on legacy platform &amp; in-app limitations&nbsp;</li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"f97bac15-f243-4bdb-95f9-3e05574c829d">***Delinea=
tion of derived versus explicit firm or firm type context for each app need=
s to be investigated and cleaned up</li>
         </ul></td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTh">Key Assumptions</th>
        <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTd">
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"a4f9b986-784a-4ca2-8ef2-dd728eeaf850">Aggregatio=
n is feasible across in-scope apps to support operating within&nbsp;</li>
         </ul></td>
       </tr>
      </tbody>
     </table>
    </div>
    <p><br></p>
   </div>
  </div>
 </div>
 <div class=3D"columnLayout single" data-layout=3D"single">
  <div class=3D"cell normal" data-type=3D"normal">
   <div class=3D"innerCell">
    <h1 id=3D"PRDUnifiedMultiFirmAccess-FeatureRequirements:FirmDelegationA=
ccessLifecycle">Feature Requirements: Firm Delegation Access Lifecycle</h1>
    <div class=3D"table-wrap">
     <table class=3D"relative-table wrapped confluenceTable" style=3D"width=
: 99.0894%;">
      <colgroup>
       <col style=3D"width: 11.9199%;">
       <col style=3D"width: 88.0691%;">
      </colgroup>
      <tbody>
       <tr>
        <th colspan=3D"2" class=3D"confluenceTh">
         <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
          <h2 id=3D"PRDUnifiedMultiFirmAccess-1-DelegateFirm&amp;UserSetup"=
><span>1 - Delegate Firm &amp; User Setup</span></h2>
         </div></th>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTh">
         <p>Roadmap Phasing</p></th>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
          <p><span class=3D"status-macro aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-success">N=
OW</span></p>
         </div></td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTh">
         <p>Problems to Solve</p></th>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"195d60cc-1e80-4cdf-b000-82d62f718bc7">Enable del=
egation of firm accounts &amp; actions to another firm's users</li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"490b9665-6de9-4ab6-aab6-c11ba5257b65">Digitize d=
elegation interactions</li>
         </ul></td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTh">
         <p>Target Users</p></th>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"61b6bfaf-56fb-4e71-8dfc-24dd3670e27e">
           <p>NBIN Firm Implementations</p></li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"4d002e77-3acf-45c6-9b75-794c6db72682">
           <p>NBIN Product Activations</p></li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"89ead5fa-e456-48f2-bd02-375a373a50fd">Firm Secur=
ity Steward of registered &amp; delegate firm</li>
         </ul></td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTh">
         <p>Requirements</p></th>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
          <p><strong>Target Delegate Firm Setup Flow</strong></p>
          <p><img class=3D"drawio-diagram-image" width=3D"468" style=3D"wid=
th:671px;max-width: 100%;" src=3D"f3e10334239d211d3837c6eff4b95858ca14ebdce=
8d06f1300890e10e94b269d" height=3D"91"><br><span>Grey =3D off CX</span></p>
          <p><strong>Registration of Firm Delegation</strong></p>
          <ul>
           <li data-uuid=3D"de562461-1a40-4174-8175-60e82a54077f">Enable ad=
dition of delegate firm(s) within a given firm profile by NBIN teams=20
            <ul>
             <li data-uuid=3D"401b5b45-6840-44c4-a7db-2c881af79fc8">For eac=
h delegate firm, specify firm ID (not name), level of feature access for th=
at firm, RR codes to include for that firm</li>
             <li data-uuid=3D"c9d37044-d8bd-4978-8d0c-e38eb3451bdc">Optiona=
lly, enable NBIN team to add known users as part of initial configuration</=
li>
            </ul></li>
           <li data-uuid=3D"2f7cf582-f30e-4f5c-af38-4f3633699d4a">Enable ad=
dition of delegate users (existing) within delegate firm=20
            <ul>
             <li data-uuid=3D"8ad7d9ea-744d-4d90-9038-1f5bd9fe6f33">Delegat=
e FSS should be able to explicitly assign existing users to one or more fir=
ms that have delegated relationships setup</li>
             <li data-uuid=3D"c3487462-070d-4e2b-974c-ecfba78eb75b">Firm sh=
ould be identified by their ID and name (minimize firm profile info shared =
with delegate firm)</li>
            </ul></li>
           <li data-uuid=3D"b50f57d4-7d08-4018-b006-29d0c687e94a">Create ne=
w users in delegate firm to assign the delegation=20
            <ul>
             <li data-uuid=3D"611207ad-4fbe-40df-b711-31565e6703d8">Enable =
identification of delegate assignment as part of new user setup within the =
delegate firm&nbsp;</li>
            </ul></li>
           <li data-uuid=3D"a6c9a6c0-7640-4e20-a5fe-4777fe704c47">Sync newl=
y established relationships back to Firm360</li>
          </ul>
         </div></td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTh">
         <p>Non-Functionals</p></th>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"8266a635-e884-4767-970a-594e18a60991">TBC</li>
         </ul></td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTh">
         <p>Out of Scope</p></th>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"cde17602-5bde-49b9-97a4-22914d5c8afe">Notificati=
ons - to be added once email notifications are available to the platform fo=
r notice to FSS of delegated firm</li>
         </ul></td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTh">
         <p>Acceptance Criteria</p></th>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"4b805126-67e5-4a8c-bd95-7b3c91e12cf2">CX is conf=
igured for the target parent/child firm based on Firm360 settings</li>
         </ul></td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTh">
         <p>Roadmap Dependencies</p></th>
        <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTd">
         <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
          <ul>
           <li data-uuid=3D"3e7d3b88-e9fe-453e-9f39-94ef899dc219">
            <p><br></p></li>
          </ul>
         </div></td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTh">
         <p>Risks &amp; Constraints</p></th>
        <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTd">
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"323fe34c-0efb-497c-b852-90e371072cd6">
           <p>TBC</p></li>
         </ul></td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTh">
         <p>Key Assumptions</p></th>
        <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTd">
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"cc880b98-6c3a-41f2-95f5-57bfe3268dd1">
           <p>Online acknowledgement of indemnity is insufficient (signatur=
e required) prior to delegation setup</p></li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"73dae2a5-4428-4515-bec3-4b937aa94a1a">Firm to fi=
rm communications can be managed between firms off-platform - an incrementa=
l enhancement to streamline delegation-related comms can be a later phase</=
li>
         </ul></td>
       </tr>
      </tbody>
     </table>
    </div>
    <p>D. Governance, Monitoring &amp; Attestation Requirements</p>
    <div class=3D"table-wrap">
     <table class=3D"wrapped confluenceTable">
      <tbody>
       <tr>
        <th class=3D"confluenceTh">
         <p>Req ID</p></th>
        <th class=3D"confluenceTh">
         <p>Requirement</p></th>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th class=3D"confluenceTh">
         <p><strong>FR=E2=80=9111</strong></p></th>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <p>PM sub=E2=80=91advisory access must be visible and reviewable d=
uring attestations.</p></td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th class=3D"confluenceTh">
         <p><strong>FR=E2=80=9112</strong></p></th>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <p>Access reviews must reflect firm relationships, not just firm I=
Ds.</p></td>
       </tr>
      </tbody>
     </table>
    </div>
    <p><br></p>
    <p>C. Lifecycle &amp; Offboarding Requirements</p>
    <div class=3D"table-wrap">
     <table class=3D"wrapped confluenceTable">
      <tbody>
       <tr>
        <th class=3D"confluenceTh">
         <p>Req ID</p></th>
        <th class=3D"confluenceTh">
         <p>Requirement</p></th>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th class=3D"confluenceTh">
         <p><strong>FR=E2=80=918</strong></p></th>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <p>Terminating a firm relationship must cascade access removal for=
 all impacted users.</p></td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th class=3D"confluenceTh">
         <p><strong>FR=E2=80=919</strong></p></th>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <p>User deactivation must consistently revoke access across all fi=
rm contexts.</p></td>
       </tr>
      </tbody>
     </table>
    </div>
   </div>
  </div>
 </div>
 <div class=3D"columnLayout single" data-layout=3D"single">
  <div class=3D"cell normal" data-type=3D"normal">
   <div class=3D"innerCell">
    <h1 id=3D"PRDUnifiedMultiFirmAccess-FeatureRequirements:DelegatedFirmOp=
erations">Feature Requirements: Delegated Firm Operations</h1>
    <p><br></p>
    <p><br></p>
   </div>
  </div>
 </div>
 <div class=3D"columnLayout single" data-layout=3D"single">
  <div class=3D"cell normal" data-type=3D"normal">
   <div class=3D"innerCell">
    <p>Operational Impact &amp; Considerations</p>
    <p>The introduction of&nbsp;<strong>Unified Multi=E2=80=91Firm Access</=
strong> represents a foundational change in how COMPASS models firm relatio=
nships and governs cross=E2=80=91firm user access. While the feature primar=
ily enhances access control and governance, it introduces important operati=
onal considerations across firm administration, access management, monitori=
ng, and support.<br>
      This section outlines the expected operational impacts and key consid=
erations to ensure successful adoption and controlled rollout.</p>
    <p>Impacted Operational Areas &amp; Considerations</p>
    <div class=3D"table-wrap">
     <table class=3D"relative-table wrapped confluenceTable" style=3D"width=
: 89.88%;">
      <colgroup>
       <col style=3D"width: 21.1345%;">
       <col style=3D"width: 30.6351%;">
       <col style=3D"width: 29.7204%;">
       <col style=3D"width: 18.4927%;">
      </colgroup>
      <tbody>
       <tr>
        <th class=3D"confluenceTh">
         <p><strong>Operational Area</strong></p></th>
        <th class=3D"confluenceTh">
         <p><strong>Impact</strong></p></th>
        <th class=3D"confluenceTh">
         <p><strong>Key Considerations</strong></p></th>
        <th class=3D"confluenceTh">
         <p><strong>Related Requirements / Capabilities</strong></p></th>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th class=3D"confluenceTh">
         <p><strong>Firm &amp; Relationship Administration</strong></p></th=
>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <p>Parent=E2=80=93child and PM sub=E2=80=91advisory relationships =
become first=E2=80=91class constructs used to govern access decisions acros=
s CX.</p></td>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <p>=E2=80=A2 Clear ownership required for firm relationship accura=
cy and lifecycle events</p>
         <p>=E2=80=A2 Data quality issues may surface during initial rollou=
t</p>
         <p>=E2=80=A2 Access enforcement becomes dependent on relationship =
data integrity</p></td>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <p>KC=E2=80=911</p>
         <p>FR=E2=80=911, FR=E2=80=912, FR=E2=80=913</p>
         <p>FO=E2=80=911</p></td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th class=3D"confluenceTh">
         <p><strong>User Access Requests &amp; Administration</strong></p><=
/th>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <p>Shift from per=E2=80=91firm user profiles to a single user iden=
tity with multi=E2=80=91firm scope, reducing duplicate requests.</p></td>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <p>=E2=80=A2 Enablement needed for Firm Security Stewards on relat=
ionship=E2=80=91based access</p>
         <p>=E2=80=A2 Guardrails required to prevent over=E2=80=91provision=
ing</p>
         <p>=E2=80=A2 Transitional complexity for legacy duplicated users</=
p></td>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <p>KC=E2=80=912, KC=E2=80=915</p>
         <p>FR=E2=80=914, FR=E2=80=917</p>
         <p>FO=E2=80=912, FO=E2=80=915</p></td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th class=3D"confluenceTh">
         <p><strong>User Experience &amp; Firm Context Awareness</strong></=
p></th>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <p>Multi=E2=80=91firm users experience reduced login friction and =
improved continuity across firm contexts.</p></td>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <p>=E2=80=A2 Firm context must be clearly visible at all times</p>
         <p>=E2=80=A2 Inconsistent context handling increases compliance ri=
sk</p>
         <p>=E2=80=A2 Support teams require updated diagnostics for cross=
=E2=80=91firm access</p></td>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <p>KC=E2=80=913</p>
         <p>FR=E2=80=915, FR=E2=80=916</p>
         <p>FO=E2=80=912, FO=E2=80=913</p></td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th class=3D"confluenceTh">
         <p><strong>Offboarding &amp; Relationship Termination</strong></p>=
</th>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <p>Terminating a firm relationship or deactivating a user can casc=
ade access removal across multiple firms.</p></td>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <p>=E2=80=A2 Strong controls needed to avoid unintended access rem=
oval</p>
         <p>=E2=80=A2 Clear distinction between user deactivation vs relati=
onship termination</p>
         <p>=E2=80=A2 High=E2=80=91impact actions require auditability</p><=
/td>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <p>KC=E2=80=916</p>
         <p>FR=E2=80=918, FR=E2=80=919</p>
         <p>FO=E2=80=914</p></td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th class=3D"confluenceTh">
         <p><strong>Monitoring, Attestation &amp; Audit</strong></p></th>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <p>Parent firm and PM sub=E2=80=91advisory access become explicitl=
y visible in attestation outputs, reducing manual reconciliation.</p></td>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <p>=E2=80=A2 Initial attestations may reveal historical access inc=
onsistencies</p>
         <p>=E2=80=A2 Firm Security Stewards need guidance on reviewing rel=
ationship=E2=80=91scoped access</p>
         <p>=E2=80=A2 Increased visibility may raise audit expectations</p>=
</td>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <p>KC=E2=80=917</p>
         <p>FR=E2=80=9110, FR=E2=80=9111, FR=E2=80=9112</p>
         <p>FO=E2=80=913</p></td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th class=3D"confluenceTh">
         <p><strong>IAM &amp; Support Operations (NBIN Internal)</strong></=
p></th>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <p>Reduced reliance on manual interpretation of requests and free=
=E2=80=91text instructions; troubleshooting becomes more structured.</p></t=
d>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <p>=E2=80=A2 Support tooling and documentation must evolve</p>
         <p>=E2=80=A2 Temporary increase in complexity during transition ph=
ase</p>
         <p>=E2=80=A2 Clear escalation paths needed for relationship disput=
es</p></td>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <p>KC=E2=80=918</p>
         <p>FR=E2=80=9113, FR=E2=80=9114, FR=E2=80=9115</p>
         <p>FO=E2=80=915</p></td>
       </tr>
      </tbody>
     </table>
    </div>
    <p><br></p>
    <p>Change Management &amp; Rollout Considerations</p>
    <ul>
     <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-uuid=
=3D"0212166d-9564-4c35-9f4c-47299ab8999f">
      <p><strong>Phased rollout</strong> is recommended, prioritizing visib=
ility and governance before full automation.</p></li>
     <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-uuid=
=3D"80b27a91-7cfd-4974-abe9-337885cf0b2d">
      <p>Early adopters should include firms with <strong>clear parent=E2=
=80=91child structures</strong> and well=E2=80=91defined sub=E2=80=91adviso=
ry agreements.</p></li>
     <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-uuid=
=3D"83767ed3-d3fc-4008-a1fa-170b81a183ea">
      <p>Targeted enablement is required for:</p>
      <ul>
       <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">
        <p>Firm Security Stewards</p></li>
       <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">
        <p>NBIN IAM / Support teams</p></li>
       <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">
        <p>Risk &amp; Compliance stakeholders</p></li>
      </ul></li>
     <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-uuid=
=3D"7ce5efdd-841d-4a7e-aa8f-27fe6d6999c0">
      <p>Metrics defined in <strong>Feature Objectives &amp; Metrics</stron=
g> should be monitored closely to validate risk reduction and operational e=
fficiency gains.</p></li>
    </ul>
    <p>Summary</p>
    <p>Unified Multi=E2=80=91Firm Access shifts COMPASS from a&nbsp;<strong=
>firm=E2=80=91centric access model</strong> to a <strong>relationship=E2=80=
=91aware access model</strong>. While this introduces new operational depen=
dencies on data quality and governance, it materially reduces long=E2=80=91=
term compliance risk, security exposure, and administrative overhead.<br>
      Careful rollout, clear ownership, and targeted enablement are critica=
l to realizing these benefits while minimizing transition risk.</p>
    <p><br></p>
    <p><span>Feature Distribution</span></p>
    <div role=3D"region" aria-label=3D"Note" class=3D"confluence-informatio=
n-macro  confluence-information-macro-note">
     <span role=3D"presentation" class=3D"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconf=
ont-warning confluence-information-macro-icon"></span>
     <div class=3D"confluence-information-macro-body">
      <p><span>Draft as inputs into feature onboarding &amp; feature activa=
tion planning, lock down once onboarding / activation planning is kicked of=
f in order to finalize any last requirements such as integration / activati=
on controls that feed into delivery refinement.<br></span></p>
     </div>
    </div>
    <p>Feature Assignment</p>
    <p>Capability Mapping</p>
    <div role=3D"region" aria-label=3D"Info" class=3D"confluence-informatio=
n-macro  confluence-information-macro-information">
     <span role=3D"presentation" class=3D"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconf=
ont-info-filled confluence-information-macro-icon"></span>
     <div class=3D"confluence-information-macro-body">
      <ul>
       <li data-uuid=3D"4ede2403-d47b-43a2-8aac-f396ecfb2cfe">
        <p>Where does it fit into our <a href=3D"https://wiki.bnc.ca/displa=
y/COMPASS/NBIN+Digital+Capabilities" rel=3D"nofollow">NBIN Digital Capabili=
ties Map</a>?</p></li>
       <li data-uuid=3D"d1bfd836-134d-4ea0-b468-a802535ec5cf">
        <p>What are the available functions: View / Manage / Control / Proc=
essing with possible intervention?</p></li>
       <li data-uuid=3D"2c4df1ef-23ee-429a-9a55-e7593e898e01">
        <p>Is this a core capability or non-core?</p></li>
      </ul>
     </div>
    </div>
    <p><br></p>
    <p>Feature Packaging &amp; Assignment</p>
    <div role=3D"region" aria-label=3D"Info" class=3D"confluence-informatio=
n-macro  confluence-information-macro-information">
     <span role=3D"presentation" class=3D"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconf=
ont-info-filled confluence-information-macro-icon"></span>
     <div class=3D"confluence-information-macro-body">
      <p>Describe who this app is intended for, e.g.:</p>
      <ul>
       <li data-uuid=3D"89411a16-1f51-4f6d-8780-abe3bede2e59">
        <p>Is it for all firms as part of our core offering, or a separate =
add-on?</p></li>
       <li data-uuid=3D"923f5b5b-25cb-471f-af2f-d61858d0b2cf">
        <p>Is it only available for certain types of firms?</p></li>
       <li data-uuid=3D"26b04f30-016d-48ac-b6cb-156437d02501">
        <p>Is this feature automatically packaged together within an app or=
 separately assignable?&nbsp; What is the rationale?&nbsp;&nbsp;</p></li>
      </ul>
     </div>
    </div>
    <p><br></p>
    <p><strong>Firm-level Assignment</strong></p>
    <p><br></p>
    <p><strong>User-level Assignment</strong></p>
    <p><br></p>
    <p>Feature Roll-Out Plan</p>
    <div role=3D"region" aria-label=3D"Info" class=3D"confluence-informatio=
n-macro  confluence-information-macro-information">
     <span role=3D"presentation" class=3D"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconf=
ont-info-filled confluence-information-macro-icon"></span>
     <div class=3D"confluence-information-macro-body">
      <p>PM is responsible for defining what validation steps are required =
to fully launch the product(s), target product readiness and validation per=
iods required.&nbsp; This is based on PM risk assessment on the path to ado=
ption.</p>
      <p>&nbsp;This section drives GTM planning and product activation.</p>
      <p>&nbsp;Roll-out planning:</p>
      <ul>
       <li data-uuid=3D"51cadc02-123a-4a1c-8958-d076cfe18011">
        <p>Does this feature require incremental validation (e.g. alpha / b=
eta / pilot / GA) and why?</p></li>
       <li data-uuid=3D"fedf13f1-0bd7-405e-980a-976d1b53f496">
        <p>Is there a decommissioning component after a certain time or as =
of GA?</p></li>
      </ul>
      <p>Change management &amp; activation planning:</p>
      <ul>
       <li data-uuid=3D"63007c94-94b0-46b8-b86b-effb5317ee9c">
        <p>For new version (replacement of an existing version, or legacy v=
ersion), describe the transition experience for the user:</p></li>
       <li data-uuid=3D"587da29f-8fdd-4297-9479-95160afdd2c0">
        <p>Where do they go today for the feature?</p></li>
       <li data-uuid=3D"d839250e-054b-4a3c-8ad8-967cc0f45713">
        <p>How will they get to the new version of the feature?</p></li>
       <li data-uuid=3D"ba905df5-dba8-4b5f-a785-63238bbe9987">
        <p>Will both versions of the feature be accessible to the user?&nbs=
p; If so, why and what is the time period?</p></li>
       <li data-uuid=3D"5162e895-7ccd-4ee3-8260-53c1c832b6a4">
        <p>Is there a change in the functionality of the new version, that =
expands what a user can do (i.e. have an impact on access controls?)</p></l=
i>
      </ul>
      <p>For net new features:</p>
      <ul>
       <li data-uuid=3D"94ff9202-ce1b-4114-979c-cfcd976579d8">
        <p>Will the roll-out be done in stages, or launched to all firms &a=
mp; users at once?</p></li>
      </ul>
     </div>
    </div>
    <p><br></p>
    <p>e.g.</p>
    <div class=3D"table-wrap">
     <table class=3D"relative-table wrapped confluenceTable" style=3D"width=
: 91.9363%;">
      <colgroup>
       <col style=3D"width: 11.4465%;">
       <col style=3D"width: 9.61994%;">
       <col style=3D"width: 9.74171%;">
       <col style=3D"width: 10.5941%;">
       <col style=3D"width: 12.2989%;">
       <col style=3D"width: 46.2681%;">
      </colgroup>
      <tbody>
       <tr>
        <th class=3D"confluenceTh">
         <p>Product</p></th>
        <th class=3D"confluenceTh">
         <p>Alpha</p></th>
        <th class=3D"confluenceTh">
         <p>Beta</p></th>
        <th class=3D"confluenceTh">
         <p>Pilot</p></th>
        <th class=3D"confluenceTh">
         <p>GA</p></th>
        <th class=3D"confluenceTh">
         <p>Activation / Deactivation&nbsp;Notes</p></th>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <p>GIC</p></td>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <p>:tick:&nbsp; Nov-Jan</p></td>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <p>:cross:&nbsp;</p></td>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <p>:tick: TBC</p></td>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <p>:tick: phasing TBC</p></td>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"abeb3498-3696-4e5e-8f81-4b0d31a7ed5b">
           <p>Replaces the current iMOST GIC instruction</p></li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"828eb74e-7d9e-40ee-8997-e9a1a0d7b83d">
           <p>Requires shut down of the old instruction as firms are transi=
tioned to avoid dual operational processing</p></li>
         </ul></td>
       </tr>
      </tbody>
     </table>
